traverso (0.50.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Upgraded upstream source code to version 0.49.1.
  * Completely migrated package build system from obsolete QMake/Qt4 to CMake and Qt6.
  * Added modern audio backend support including PipeWire and modern LV2 features.
  * Refactored architecture evaluation rules to fully support cross-compilation.
  * Updated debhelper compatibility suite to modern version 13.

